Outbound groups and node references
-----------------------------------

Selector and URLTest groups refer to nodes by their UCI section ID. The section
ID is an internal reference and is not the display name, so a node or group
label can be renamed safely. On upgrade, a unique legacy label reference is
migrated to its section ID; ambiguous or missing labels are left for review.
Before deleting a node, remove it from every group that references it. This
example contains no subscription URLs, server addresses, or credentials.
